# Workflow

## Before editing
Task type: content / UI / SEO / new page / infrastructure. Open the matching file in `js/data/` or a sample in `js/pages/`.

## Minimal diff
One concern at a time: one CSS token, one subpage, one menu item. Keep section comments (`/* ========== MARKETING ========== */`).

## New page
1. `SUBPAGES['section/slug']` or section in `pages.jsx`
2. Link in `MEGA` / cards
3. SEO entry (static or auto from `lede`)
4. With path routing — URL in `sitemap.xml`

## Local check
`index.html` via live server. Routes: `#home`, `#marketing/crm`, `#portfolio`, dark theme, 375px. No console errors.

## Commits
Only when the user asks. No secrets or analytics keys in the repo.

## Ask the user first
New top-level menu section; domain change; CMS/form backend; removing robot/tweaks; Vite migration.
